<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-4173] IgniteSemaphore with failoverSafe enabled doesn&apos;t release permits in case permits owner node left topology</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-4173</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;IgniteSemaphore&lt;/tt&gt; with &lt;tt&gt;failoverSafe&lt;/tt&gt; enabled doesn&apos;t release permits in case permits owner node left topology.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;See reproducer in test class &lt;tt&gt;SemaphoreFailoverSafeReleasePermitsTest&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
