                            <comment id="15897669" author="amashenkov" created="Mon, 6 Mar 2017 17:16:30 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Seems it is duplicate of &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1977&quot; title=&quot;IgniteSemaphore&amp;#39;s failover related tests lead to the deadlock or fail&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-1977&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-1977&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15965847" author="githubbot" created="Wed, 12 Apr 2017 13:32:27 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;GitHub user vladisav opened a pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/1780&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/1780&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

